# ui-design-director → GitHub

Whenever you create, edit, or register anything under the **ui-design-director** skill (`~/.cursor/skills/ui-design-director/` or the `Endeavor068/ui-design-director` repo):

1. Treat the skill folder as the git checkout of https://github.com/Endeavor068/ui-design-director
2. After the edit, run git status / diff / log, commit with a clear message, and **push to `origin`**
3. Do not finish the turn with uncommitted or unpushed skill changes
4. Never skip hooks or force-push to main unless the user explicitly asks

This overrides “only commit when asked” for this skill only — the user required publish-on-update.
